  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="Input loader (dispatcher part) of Lyrebird_10_DP: reads wishlist rows with status 'new' from Supabase and adds one Lyrebird_Validate queue item per row.&#xA;&#xA;Safe to run repeatedly: the Reference ('&lt;artist&gt; - &lt;album&gt; | WL-&lt;id&gt;-S&lt;submission&gt;') is unique per row and submission and is persisted on the row (queue_reference) once per submission BEFORE the item is added, then reused unchanged, duplicates inside the batch are skipped, and the queue's 'Enforce unique references' rejects rows that are already queued. Only that confirmed rejection (OrchestratorHttpException, HTTP 409, 'Duplicate Reference') is absorbed; every other error is logged and rethrown.&#xA;Dry run sends nothing: it reports 'would add' separately from 'added' and cannot know what is already queued.&#xA;Writes to Supabase only the queue_reference of a new submission (guarded PATCH, PersistQueueReference); the wishlist status is not changed here.&#xA;Not connected to Main.xaml yet." DisplayName="Load New Wishlist Items" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_1">
